  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Albania: INSTAT IT procurement 2015-2017 - INSTAT review of internal financial control KPMG</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Albanien: INSTAT upphandling 2015-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r att en rad upphandlingar sker till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r den nationella statistikbyr&#xe5;n i Albaniens (INSTAT) fortsatta utveckling mot kompetens som motsvarar kraven i EU-n&#xe4;rmandet, kapitel 18 Statistik i EUs kravlista. Upphandlingarna inneb&#xe4;r att INSTATs IT-utrustning moderniseras samt att ett nytt utbildningscenter inom INSTAT etableras. Detta projekt &#xe4;r parallellt till det institutionella samarbetet mellan INSTAT och SCB som Sida ocks&#xe5; finansierar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes a number of procurements to support The national statistical institute of Albania (INSTAT) in its continued competence development to achieve the requirements for the EU accession in Chapter 18 Statistics of the Aqui communitaire. The procurements will lead to the modernisation of INSTAT&#xb4;s IT equipment and that a new training centre at INSTAT will be established. This project is parallel to the institutional cooperation between INSTAT and Statistics Sweden (SCB) also funded by Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to modernize the already existing infrastructue platform and establishment of a training center and equip enumerators with mobile devices for field interviews.</narrative>
  </description>
